Review→`outcome_review::apply_decision` accept/revise/reject reusing CLI helpers). Full 4-seam wiring mirrors evidence_curation. Slash `/review-outcome <workdir>` + `/review-outcome-write`; counts 87→89. 6 FSM + 3 router tests; clippy + ceiling clean. **Adversarially reviewed (2-lens finder→verify workflow) — 4 CONFIRMED findings all fixed `844a97d6`:** (med) TUI didn't surface a prior `outcome.decision` → re-accept silently re-clobbered draft-final.md — added `ReviewSummary.prior_decision` + render note; (low) `concerns()`/`is_clean()` could disagree (non-GREEN status + no *named* defects, e.g. unresolved «Qnn» → STOP-AND-SURFACE with empty defect list) showed "clean run — no concerns" while recommending Revise — `concerns()` now emits a status-based concern so it's NEVER empty when `is_clean()` false (also fixes the CLI presenter); (low) `accept_draft` had no src==dest guard → `--out draft.md` truncated the draft — skip copy when same file; (low) interactive accept dropped the CLI's unclean-run warning — now noted in the msg. bin 975 / tui 439 / evidence 26 green. **Registry count-constant lockstep is a FOOTGUN — bump `dispatcher.rs::EXPECTED_PRIMARY_COUNT` + `registry/tests/mod.rs::EXPECTED_COMMAND_COUNT` whenever you add a slash primary (Phase-4 `/curate` left them stale → 6 red tests, fixed `b004a4ff`).** ✅ **Phase-4 `o` bbox-PNG page viewer DONE `b4ff37ca`** — archon-docs pub sync `render_page_region_png_blocking(pdf,page,bbox)` (pdftoppm -singlefile + crop_region; +`#[ignore]` live test via `ARCHON_TEST_PDF`); `o` in /curate Review stages a `PageRequest` → bin `/curate-page` renders+writes PNG+best-effort opens (wslview/xdg-open/open), result shown in overlay status line (new `CuratePageResult` event + `EvidenceCuration.status` field). counts 89→90. Live-verified pdftoppm 24.02 on Lanham PDF (830×1233). **NO deferred items remain.**

