**Phase 4 COMPLETE** (inc.1 assembly `4c581761` · inc.2 FSM `254fad5a` · inc.3a bridge `65e10dc7` · inc.3b wiring `2e0e4515`): interactive `/curate <question>` → discover (index if present) → per-candidate keep/annotate (Review) → terminology-locks → confirm → gp_validate-clean `pack.json`+bank in `<cwd>/curated-packs/<slug>/`. 4-seam wired (app/events/tui_events/input/render) + `event_loop/evidence_curation.rs` router + bin `/curate`+`/curate-write`. 22 tests. **DEFERRED polish:** `o` bbox-PNG viewer (stub — `pdf_figure_vlm::render_page_png`+crop); richer scaffold form (defaults used for section metadata beyond question+locks); gate_config_path defaults to `ga-gate-locked-v2.json` (may need copying into pack dir for draftability). **LIVE interactive verify (drive TUI → real pack) = USER Phase-6 step** (like /draft wizard). input.rs whitelisted (494→505, split-soon).

**(older)** 9 commits.**

**Phase 4 (curation TUI) — building BOTTOM-UP, increments:** ✅ **inc.1 assembly core `4c581761`** (`archon-evidence::pack`: `CuratedQuote`+`PackScaffold`→`assemble_pack()`→gp_validate-clean `Pack`+bank; `write_pack()`; 4 tests; +archon-draft dep). ✅ **inc.2 FSM screen `254fad5a`** — `crates/archon-tui/src/screens/evidence_curation.rs` (+`_util.rs` to stay <500) pure state machine Section→Review→Locks→Confirm; gates (empty-section, ≥1 kept quote + claim-per-quote footer-gate, ≥1 lock); `advance()→NeedRetrieval/Stepped/Blocked/Done(CurationResult)`; `ReviewItem` plain-fields (decoupled from archon-evidence); 7 tests. ✅ **inc.3a bridge `65e10dc7`** — `src/command/curate.rs` (bin, deps both crates): `candidate_to_review_item()` (Candidate→ReviewItem, prefers exact/bbox provenance span; `short_source()` strips `_(year)_[copy]`) + `curation_to_pack()` (CurationResult→PackScaffold+CuratedQuote[], section slug, dissertation defaults). 4 tests incl. END-TO-END result→assemble_pack→gp_validate-clean. `#![allow(dead_code)]` until wired.
**REMAINING: inc.3b = THE SEAM-PLUMBING (mechanical, mirror draft_wizard exactly — all seams LOCATED):** app.rs (field `evidence_curation:Option<EvidenceCuration>` @~141, init @~184, is_none check @~215); events.rs `ShowEvidenceCuration{section,items:Vec<ReviewItem>,cwd}` variant @~382 + Display arm @~471; tui_events.rs handler @~146 (mirror ShowDraftWizard→construct screen); input.rs capture @251 (`try_handle_evidence_curation`) + paste @488; NEW `event_loop/evidence_curation.rs` router (mirror `handle_draft_wizard_key`); render: pickers.rs `draw_evidence_curation` @82 + body.rs re-export @23 + mod.rs call @78; `/curate <question>` slash cmd (mirror `open_draft_wizard` in draft.rs:477 + `ctx.emit` :523 + registry `src/command/registry/default.rs:65`) discovers+maps+emits; **flow B (simplest): /curate arg pre-discovers → open at Review; Esc→Section edits→re-`/curate`**. Done handoff: TUI writes CurationResult JSON to temp + re-injects `/curate-write <path>` (needs Serialize/Deserialize on ReviewItem+CurationResult — archon-tui HAS serde). `o` action = `pdf_figure_vlm::render_page_png`+crop. inc.4 = live verify real pack.json through TUI. **Reuse:** `screens/evidence_browser.rs`, `src/command/evidence_view.rs`, Evidence Engine views.

**Phase 3 — `6cd6691a`:** new `archon-evidence::index` reader over `index/compiled-index.json` (542 nodes/1442 canonical terms/64 tension edges) wired into `discover()` behind `--index`: canonical-term greedy-longest-match query expansion (gloss→greek/aliases), owning-work token-boost re-rank (centralityTier normalized — it's LEAKY), tension-edge both-poles surfacing. **KEY finding: naive semantic query-augmentation DEGRADES retrieval on an English-translation corpus (appended greek/German isn't in the translation) — fixed by merge(original+augmented, max-score) + ORIGINAL-query-priority ranking + chunk_id tiebreak, so --index never worse than plain + owning-work first.** Adversarially reviewed — **4 confirmed** (nondeterminism + augmented-displacement fixed in `6cd6691a`; then follow-up `91ddc26b`: **[HIGH] Greek-query PANIC** in find_unconsumed_word — mid-codepoint `start` advance crashed the --index path for any Greek term, 142/1442 terms Greek-initial; + [MEDIUM] work_boost author-level over-routing → require work-specific token + match FILENAME not full path). 11 index tests + live A/B verified ("poor in world"→FCM on top+weltarm coverage; energeia→GA18; readiness↔presence tension; Greek repro no-panic). **Phase 4 asset: reuse `src/command/evidence_view.rs` + archon-tui "Evidence Engine" views for the curation TUI.**

**Progress:** Phase 0 — branch cut; baseline build+gauntlet green; corpus queryable (Calleja In-Game exact-1.00+bbox); `./index/` committed `e910839c` (WIPE before upstream PR). **Fork creation + push DEFERRED to Phase 7** (outward-facing; conflicts with no-push-until-verified — local branch is the WSL rollback point; nothing in 1–6 needs the remote). Phase 1 — `a3126b02` locator join (Bekker/page through quote_verify, +sentinel-bbox drop, +deterministic tie-break, 7 tests) · `d4a6c739` declare() names resolved model not hardcoded Fable5 (+CI-safe threading test). Adversarially reviewed (4 confirmed→fixed, 2 refuted); fmt/clippy/ceiling green. Surfaced [[project-archon-locator-data-quality]] — PageNumber locators LOW TRUST (ingestion misclassifies line-numbers), resolve later. Phase 2 — `c98aca59` NEW crate `archon-evidence`: `discover(db,query,opts)` = archon-docs hybrid retrieval → per-candidate re-anchor to exact-1.00 page+bbox via `quote_verify` (guards on chunk_id vs first-occurrence mis-anchor); dev CLI `archon evidence find "<q>" [--collection C][--mode][--json]`. Trust policy applied at CONSUMER: Bekker=citation-grade, PageNumber=LOW TRUST label. Adversarially reviewed (5 confirmed→fixed). Verified live on 6 Part-II queries (Calleja→new_media, Heidegger→rhetorical_ontology, Aristotle→metaphysics; all exact-1.00+bbox). **Phase-4 asset found:** pre-existing `src/command/evidence_view.rs` + archon-tui "Evidence Engine" TUI views inspect the same corpus DB — reuse as the curation-TUI foundation.

**Strategy (decided, grounded in verified analysis):** Do NOT upgrade god-agent ICP and port. Build the interactive layer **natively in archon-cli**. Archon already owns the hard/best pieces — exact-1.00 + page + **bbox** verbatim provenance (`archon-docs::quote_verify` + `doc_chunk_spatial`), a rigorous gauntlet (mechanical + G-A Lanham + G-E/G-G LLM judges + ≤3 revise), tamper-evident reproducibility, subscription-capable billing (`resolve_auth_with_keys`, OAuth/Claude-Code identity). It LACKS live retrieval at draft time (pack-embedded bank only; `archon-docs` RAG + `archon-leann` exist but unwired to `archon-draft`), a compiled index, and in-run interactive evidence review. **Keep FCDP (D1/D1.5/D2 + counterargument block) as the argument engine unchanged**; add an interactive **evidence-discovery-and-curation front-end that produces the `Pack`** (which is `Serialize`/buildable) the engine drafts from. ICP + the Perplexity report = design spec, not code to port.

**Phases:** 0 fork/baseline · 1 provenance quick-wins (surface Bekker `doc_locators` through `quote_verify`; fix `provenance::declare` hardcoded "Fable 5" mislabel) · 2 `archon-evidence` crate wiring `archon-docs` hybrid retrieval + bbox · 3 read in-repo `./index/compiled-index.json` (542 nodes/1442 canonical terms) → canonical-term expansion + author/work routing + tension edges (biggest build) · 4 interactive curation TUI extending the draft wizard (facet→retrieve→human evidence review w/ bbox→assemble Pack) · 5 curation→draft→outcome-review + draft-time bank re-verify · 6 **USER personal WSL sign-off (hard gate)** · 7 push+Mac test · 8 upstream PR prep.

**Resolved decisions:** D1 = **new dedicated fork** (`ProfessorVR/archon-cli-evidence`, remote `evidence`, branch `feat/evidence-curation` off `feat/fcdp-draft@926285ad`). D2 = read in-repo `./index/` (user copied full god-agent index tree in). D3 = target **Part II** (metaphysics, methodology, G&G, RDR2). Phase-0.5 = **commit `./index/`** so it reaches the Mac **BUT WIPE it before the final upstream PR** (it's a working data asset). D4 = TUI + on-demand bbox PNG.

**Discipline:** WSL-first; new fork = rollback; no push/Mac-sync until user's Phase-6 sign-off; standing rules [[feedback-archon-push-from-wsl-only]] [[feedback-archon-no-push-until-verified]] [[feedback-archon-mac-sync-needs-permission]].

Design inputs: [[project-icp-drafting-analysis-report]] (§5 portable features, §7 integration). Extends the draft-wizard "Phase 2 pack-authoring scaffold" (handoff `~/projects/archon-cli/.tmp/HANDOFF-draft-wizard-2026-07-09.md`). Archon corpus = 126 PDFs across metaphysics/new_media/rhetorical_ontology/textual_analysis/virtual_learning_environments, with bbox.
